seg-e7ba76a06aa6 = <b>Command line.</b> The CLI dispatches on the scenario’s <c1/> field and writes <c2/>, <c3/>, <c4/> and <c5/> next to the input (JSON is JavaScript Object Notation, SVG Scalable Vector Graphics, HTML HyperText Markup Language). A few kinds also publish a reproducibility table as <c6/> (comma-separated values): <c7/>, <c8/>, <c9/>, <c10/>, <c11/>, and <c12/> when an export site is set. None of the three tutorials is one of them, so you will not see that file here.

# text
