# c2: cargo install kshana
# c3: kshana scenarios/orbit-sgp4-gps.toml
# c4: kshana example
# c5: kshana example orbit-sgp4-gps > orbit-sgp4-gps.toml
# c6: scenarios/orbit-sgp4-gps.toml
