seg-893276648fec = <b>Reports.</b> Every run writes <c1/> and <c2/> (see <a1>REPORTS.md</a1>). <c3/> runs a suite of scenarios into one <c4/> and <c5/>, for example <c6/>.

# text
# c1: kshana <scenario.toml> --animate <svg|html|frames|all>
# c2: --animate html
# c3: scenarios/orbit-sgp4-gps.toml
# c4: orbit-sgp4-gps.animation.html
# c5: solar-system
seg-e9f06d47c82c = <c1/> renders the run’s time series, for example <c2/> on <c3/> writes <c4/>. A kind with no sampled time axis (such as <c5/>) is refused with an error; see <a1>ANIMATION.md</a1>.

