seg-3977722b8517 = <c1/> writes the result for other tools: CZML (Cesium Language), KML (Keyhole Markup Language, for Google Earth), GeoJSON (geographic JSON), an STK (Systems Tool Kit) ephemeris, or a SigMF (Signal Metadata Format) recording. <c2/> says which formats apply to a scenario; SigMF applies only to <c3/>. The orbit pack also exports <c4/>, <c5/> and <c6/> (CCSDS, the Consultative Committee for Space Data Systems, orbit messages). See <a1>INTEROP.md</a1>.

